    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Immerse yourself in a psychological horror story set in the rich and mysterious fantasy worlds of T\u00faatha.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>T\u00faatha Echoes: The Village</strong> is the first story in the <i>Echoes</i> series, introducing the unique setting of T\u00faatha inspired by pre-Celtic mythology and lore. This short visual novel invites you to uncover the grim fate of a small forest village, where something dark has taken root.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the first <i>Echo</i> in a series of stories, <strong>The Village</strong> sets the stage for a magical world steeped in ancient lore. With beautifully illustrated scenes and a dark chilling narrative, this visual novel offers a glimpse into the legends and characters that will shape the future of the T\u00faatha universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the dark depths of a world filled with magic and mystery and join us as we forge a new fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tuatha Echoes: The Village\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple Linear Story</strong>: Enjoy a simple linear narrative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich Worldbuilding</strong>: Delve into the lore of T\u00faatha, uncovering dark secrets that hint at deeper mysteries yet to be explored. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>: Experience the slow descent into madness through atmospheric visuals and immersive sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lose yourself in <i>T\u00faatha Echoes: The Village</i>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Immerse yourself in a psychological horror story set in the rich and mysterious fantasy worlds of T\u00faatha.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>T\u00faatha Echoes: The Village</strong> is the first story in the <i>Echoes</i> series, introducing the unique setting of T\u00faatha inspired by pre-Celtic mythology and lore. This short visual novel invites you to uncover the grim fate of a small forest village, where something dark has taken root.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the first <i>Echo</i> in a series of stories, <strong>The Village</strong> sets the stage for a magical world steeped in ancient lore. With beautifully illustrated scenes and a dark chilling narrative, this visual novel offers a glimpse into the legends and characters that will shape the future of the T\u00faatha universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the dark depths of a world filled with magic and mystery and join us as we forge a new fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tuatha Echoes: The Village\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple Linear Story</strong>: Enjoy a simple linear narrative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich Worldbuilding</strong>: Delve into the lore of T\u00faatha, uncovering dark secrets that hint at deeper mysteries yet to be explored. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>: Experience the slow descent into madness through atmospheric visuals and immersive sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lose yourself in <i>T\u00faatha Echoes: The Village</i>.</p>",
